        "created_at": "2013-10-31T02:20:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The game I was proposing to do this with was UFO: Alien Invasion, assuming I can figure out a way to post screenshots straight to the forum rather than having to post them to something like Picasa or Photobucket first.</p><p>The one other thing I'd note about what I was proposing in this instance was that I was going to try to get input from the other forumites regarding improtant tactical decisions like locating bases, projects to research, and production items to queue. UFO:AI also allows a lot of renaming to soldiers, and folks would get the opportunity to have somebody named after themselves, including selection of speciality/armament.</p>",
